@bank all
// B2 (2026-10-26, Pillar 5 Step 5, S5-3 turn 2; lead 39: the builder writes them, RV20 reads them): M19's conduit runs
// (stage 2, with the conduit tester), the Senior's part of the Wednesday drill, and Calder's two words (said through
// worksTeach with these as her lines). Placeholders as lines_check allows: {where} the crawlway side, {text} the decks a
// conduit feeds, {deck} and {n} a feed and its reading, {n} the call's number. No "!". The Works house style: short, plain.

// conduit runs: the card, the side, the inspection box, the tester, the pick, a wrong pick, done
== m19.card.run
- Test the conduit run: {where} crawlway
== m19.side.port
- port
== m19.side.stbd
- starboard
== m19.run.open
- The inspection box. A feed for each deck above: {text}.
== m19.run.tester
- The tester on each feed:
== m19.run.feed
- Deck {deck}: {n}
== m19.run.pick
- Which feed reads low?
== m19.run.option
- Deck {deck}
== m19.run.wrong
- That one reads normal. Look at the numbers again.
== m19.run.done
- Feed tagged and logged. The run's sound again.

// the Senior's drill (Wednesdays, 15:00): the card, Calder's word at 14:50, the ring line, each call's card
== m19.drill.card
- The drill: run the Works calls
== m19.drill.toast
- Drill in ten minutes. You run the Works calls today. Muster hatch, Works bay.
== m19.drill.ring
- Run the Works part of the drill
== m19.drill.title
- Your call, {n} of 3
== m19.drill.text
- The bay's waiting on you. What's the call?
// the three calls (listed in a shuffled order; the right order is muster, the week's action, the bridge)
== m19.drill.muster
- Muster: Works team to stations
== m19.drill.fire
- Fire teams to the hatch, extinguishers out
== m19.drill.pressure
- Dog the bulkhead doors
== m19.drill.power
- The junior wing to reserve power
== m19.drill.report
- Report to the bridge: Works ready
// the crew answering: 0 Torres, 1 Halloran (by the week's drill), 2 Calder for the bridge
== m19.drill.ans.0
- Works team at stations.
== m19.drill.ans.1.fire
- Extinguishers out. Hatch covered.
== m19.drill.ans.1.pressure
- Bulkhead dogged. Four turns.
== m19.drill.ans.1.power
- Junior wing on reserve.
== m19.drill.ans.2
- Bridge copies. Good.
// Calder: a call out of order, and her word at the all-clear (clean, some out of order, missed)
== m19.drill.order
- Muster, then the action, then the bridge. In that order.
== m19.drill.clean
- Clean calls. That's how it's done.
== m19.drill.ok
- Muster, act, report. Next time in that order first go.
== m19.drill.missed
- We ran it without your calls. Next Wednesday, they're yours.

// Calder in person after the ask ({time}, {where}: the relay room), and once you reach stage 2 (three relay or battery jobs)
== m19.ask.say
- {time}, the bridge's {where}. Power and relays. I'll meet you there.
== m19.stage2
- You've got relays. Next: the conduit runs under Deck 6. Bring your tester.
